 "html": "<div class=\"space-y-6 p-6\"><header><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Job matches</h1><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Which roles suit the way you're actually wired, and how far you are from each one. Pick a role to see where you already match it and where there's ground to make up.</p></header><section aria-labelledby=\"ds-matches-heading\"><div class=\"mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><h2 id=\"ds-matches-heading\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>3 roles to compare with</h2><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"How to order your matches\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg border border-border p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors bg-primary/10 font-medium text-primary\">Closest to the role</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\">Best overall match</button></div></div><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border p-3 text-left transition-colors border-primary bg-primary/5\"><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><span class=\"block truncate font-medium\">Forklift Operator</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span title=\"A job your organisation has blueprinted\" data-job-set=\"local\" class=\"shrink-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-[rgba(13,148,136,0.12)] text-[#0f766e]\">Local</span></span></span></span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right\"><span class=\"block text-2xl font-semibold leading-none text-teal-600\">79<span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">%</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">fit</span></span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border p-3 text-left transition-colors border-border bg-background hover:border-primary/50\"><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><span class=\"block truncate font-medium\">Registered Nurse</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span title=\"From the national job library\" data-job-set=\"national\" class=\"shrink-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-[#f3f4f6] text-[#6b7280]\">National</span></span></span></span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right\"><span class=\"block text-2xl font-semibold leading-none text-emerald-600\">84<span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">%</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">fit</span></span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border p-3 text-left transition-colors border-border bg-background hover:border-primary/50\"><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><span class=\"block truncate font-medium\">Electrician</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span title=\"From the national job library\" data-job-set=\"national\" class=\"shrink-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-[#f3f4f6] text-[#6b7280]\">National</span></span></span></span><span class=\"shrink-0 text-right\"><span class=\"block text-2xl font-semibold leading-none text-teal-600\">71<span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">%</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">fit</span></span></button></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"ds-breakdown-heading\"><h2 id=\"ds-breakdown-heading\" class=\"mb-2 text-sm font-medium\">Where you stand</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-2 p-5\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold leading-none text-teal-600\">79<span class=\"text-xl text-muted-foreground\">%</span></span><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><span class=\"block font-medium\">Forklift Operator</span><span class=\"block text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Well aligned, with room to grow</span></span></div></div><p class=\"rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/40 p-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Compared with the role's published benchmark.</p></div></section></div>",
